# bat config — flags applied to every `bat` invocation. One arg per
# line; supports `#` comments. See `man bat` for the full option set.

# Match the unified theme. `chezmoi-system` is generated from .chezmoidata/theme.yaml
# (by custom-builds/theme/generate-theme.sh) and registered via
# `bat cache --build` (run_onchange script). Other previewers/tools share this
# palette via their own configs (fzf in zshrc, yazi syntect preview, etc.).
--theme="chezmoi-system"
